&lt;li&gt;Define clear service boundaries, data models, schemas, and API contracts that other teams can use confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build capabilities supporting merchant acquisition, identity, marketing technology, operations, risk, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical work end to end, from discovery and system design through implementation, testing, deployment, and production follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernise existing services and improve reliability through observability, security, failure handling, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Data, Operations, Compliance, Risk, Sales, Marketing, and other engineering teams to turn complex requirements into practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code and designs, make pragmatic technical trade-offs, share knowledge, and mentor engineers around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
