&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based in Germany. If located near an office, you are expected to work from that office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use consultative techniques to uncover customers&#39; pain points and business needs within their current or intended processes and ways of working, plus quantify why these needs are important.&lt;/li&gt;
