&lt;li&gt;Keep a vehicle telemetry platform moving billions of messages a day without the Kafka consumers falling over.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the engineering spine of a mobile wallet used by more than two billion people across four continents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship the data product behind peer-review submissions for one of the world&#39;s largest scientific publishers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The list changes every quarter. The pattern doesn&#39;t: data-heavy, distributed, and often sitting on top of something that already exists and isn&#39;t perfect.&lt;/p&gt;
