&lt;li&gt;Build individualised development plans within the SDR organisation; celebrate growth at every level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the SDR ramp-up framework: design structured onboarding for new SDRs that accounts for regional variation across a globally distributed team and tracks milestone attainment through to full productivity&lt;/li&gt;
